{title: Shaam Gulabi}
{artist: Sachin Jigar}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Shaam gulabi, [B]sehar gulabi,        [F#m]Pehar gulabi hai gu [B]labi ye shehar
[F#m]Main bhi gulabi,        [B]Tu hai gulabi
[F#m]Din bhi gulabi hai [B]gulabi ye kehar,        [F#m]Gulabi dori hai
[B]Bandhi ye chori hai,        [F#m]Naa jora-jori naa [B]seena zori hai
[F#m]Gulabi dori hai,        [B]Bandhi ye chori hai
[F#m]Naa roka-toki hai na [B]seena zori hai re,        [F#m]Rang bhi gulabi
Ye [B]naav bhi gulabi,        [F#m]Dariya me jo main [B]bahun gulabi
[F#m]Kahun bhi gulabi,        Main [B]sahun bhi gulabi
[F#m]Lagta hai main [B]rahun gulabi,        [F#m]Jaane re jaane mann [E]jaane hai
Rang, [A]rang gulabi hai [F#m]preet ro,        [F#m]Jaane re jaane sab [B]jaane hai
Rang, [E]Rang gulabi hai preet [F#m]ro,        [F#m]Jaane re jaane sab [E]jaane hai
Rang, [A]Rang gulabi hai [F#m]preet ro,        [F#m]Gulabi dori hai
[B]Bandhi ye chori hai,        [F#m]Naa jora-jori naa [B]seena zori hai
[F#m]Gulabi dori hai,        [B]Bandhi ye chori hai
[F#m]Naa roka-toki hai na [B]seena zori hai re,        [F#m]Nain gulabi [B]chain gulabi
[F#m]Dawa bhi gulabi hai gu [B]labi hai asar,        [F#m]Naav gulabi ye [B]nain gulabi
[F#m]Nain gulabi hai [B]gulabi hai safar,        [F#m]Haule gulabi hain [B]tez gulabi
